## 🚀 How to Run Locally

### Prerequisites
Ensure you have [R](https://cloud.r-project.org/) and [RStudio](https://posit.co/download/rstudio-desktop/) installed.

### 1. Install Dependencies
Run the following code in your R environment to install all required packages:

```r
install.packages(c(
  "shiny", "leaflet", "leaflet.extras", "sf", "DT", "dplyr", 
  "bslib", "shinyWidgets", "geojsonsf", "jsonlite", "writexl", 
  "httr", "xml2", "rmarkdown"
))
